---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base>
  <div class="shelf" role="main">

    <!-- Cover -->
    <article class="book" id="book-cover" data-open="true">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-cover" aria-expanded="true" aria-label="Home">
        Blake Reichenbach
      </button>
      <div class="book-page cover-page" id="page-cover">
        <div class="cover-inner">
          <img src="/images/blake.jpg" alt="Blake Reichenbach" class="cover-photo" />
          <h1 class="cover-name">Blake<br />Reichenbach</h1>
          <div class="cover-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <p class="cover-tagline">
            Product manager, writer, and builder of things. Drawn to curiosity and craft.
          </p>
          <p class="cover-hint" aria-hidden="true">select a volume to explore &rarr;</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- About -->
    <article class="book" id="book-about">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-about" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="About">
        About
      </button>
      <div class="book-page text-page" id="page-about" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="page-header">
          <span class="chapter-num" aria-hidden="true">I</span>
          <h2 class="chapter-title">About</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="page-body">
          <p>
            I'm a product manager by trade and a writer by compulsion, which means I spend a lot
            of time thinking about why things are built the way they are — and whether they could
            be better.
          </p>
          <p>
            As a PM, I've spent my career on ambitious, zero-to-one launches. The work I'm most
            proud of starts with genuine curiosity about what people actually need — not what they
            say they want, not what's easiest to build — and ends with something that earns their
            trust. I think of that as product taste: the ability to turn empathy into decisions.
          </p>
          <blockquote class="pull-quote">
            "Product taste: the ability to turn empathy into decisions."
          </blockquote>
          <p>
            That same instinct shows up everywhere. PRactical exists because I saw a gap in
            the market for a workout tracker that respects the user's intelligence — no bloat, no
            dark patterns, just a clean tool that does exactly what it promises. Non-Slop Fun
            exists because I believe the well-examined life is worth writing about, and that
            genuine creative and cultural commentary is an act of resistance against the default
            mode of mindless scrolling. The Berea Writers Cabin exists because a space should mean
            something — it should invite the kind of thinking that doesn't happen on a laptop screen.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'm based in Kentucky. I'm a certified personal trainer who mostly just trains himself.
            I'm working on two novels — an Appalachian dark fantasy about ecology, class, and what
            it means to come home, and a high fantasy rooted in the mythology of gods and the people
            who live in their shadow. Both are works in progress, which feels like the right place
            for them to be.
          </p>
          <p>
            If you've landed here, you're probably curious, you make things, and you're a little
            skeptical of anything that was built to game your attention rather than earn it. Welcome.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Non-Slop Fun -->
    <article class="book" id="book-nonslopfun">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-nonslopfun" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Non-Slop Fun newsletter">
        Non-Slop Fun
      </button>
      <div class="book-page project-page" id="page-nonslopfun" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="project-frontispiece">
          <img src="/images/nonslop.png" alt="Non-Slop Fun — a collage illustration of a figure in a suit holding coffee" />
        </div>
        <div class="project-body">
          <span class="project-tag">Newsletter</span>
          <h2 class="project-title">Non-Slop Fun</h2>
          <p class="project-desc">
            Reflection is resistance. Non-Slop Fun is a newsletter about creative and cultural
            commentary — examining the things worth examining, and celebrating the well-examined life.
          </p>
          <a href="https://www.nonslopfun.com" class="project-cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Read it &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- PRactical Workouts -->
    <article class="book" id="book-practical">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-practical" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="PRactical Workouts iOS app">
        PRactical
      </button>
      <div class="book-page project-page" id="page-practical" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="project-frontispiece project-frontispiece--app">
          <img src="/images/practical.png" alt="PRactical Workouts app home screen showing weekly training stats" />
        </div>
        <div class="project-body">
          <span class="project-tag">iOS App</span>
          <h2 class="project-title">PRactical Workouts</h2>
          <p class="project-desc">
            A workout tracker for lifters who want a clean, intelligent tool without the bloat.
            No social features, no AI gimmicks — just straightforward progressive overload
            tracking done right.
          </p>
          <a href="https://www.practicalworkouts.com" class="project-cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Download &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Creator's Hearth -->
    <article class="book" id="book-hearth">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-hearth" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Creator's Hearth writing site">
        Creator's Hearth
      </button>
      <div class="book-page project-page" id="page-hearth" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="project-frontispiece">
          <img src="/images/creators-hearth.png" alt="Creator's Hearth — a watercolor fireplace logo" />
        </div>
        <div class="project-body">
          <span class="project-tag">Writing &amp; Craft</span>
          <h2 class="project-title">Creator's Hearth</h2>
          <p class="project-desc">
            A niche site for writers who take the craft seriously. Practical guidance, honest
            takes, and a growing library of resources for fiction writers at every stage.
          </p>
          <a href="#" class="project-cta">Visit &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Berea Writers Cabin -->
    <article class="book" id="book-cabin">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-cabin" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Berea Writers Cabin short-term rental">
        Berea Writers Cabin
      </button>
      <div class="book-page project-page" id="page-cabin" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="project-frontispiece project-frontispiece--photo">
          <img src="/images/cabin.jpg" alt="The Berea Writers Cabin nestled in the Appalachian foothills" />
        </div>
        <div class="project-body">
          <span class="project-tag">Short-Term Rental &middot; Berea, KY</span>
          <h2 class="project-title">Berea Writers Cabin</h2>
          <p class="project-desc">
            A creative retreat in the Appalachian foothills, steeped in regional charm and
            designed for the kind of thinking that requires a change of scenery.
          </p>
          <span class="project-cta-disabled">Bookings Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Product Work -->
    <article class="book" id="book-work">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-work" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Product work">
        Product Work
      </button>
      <div class="book-page text-page" id="page-work" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="page-header">
          <span class="chapter-num" aria-hidden="true">II</span>
          <h2 class="chapter-title">Product Work</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="work-intro">Selected work from my time as a Product Manager at HubSpot.</p>
        <div class="work-list">

          <div class="work-entry">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Trust &amp; Safety</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Fraud Detection &amp; ML Modernization</h3>
            <p class="work-desc">
              Overhauled fraud detection in Trust &amp; Safety to leverage machine learning.
              Maintained accuracy and precision across key threat detection categories while laying
              the groundwork to shift from reactive to proactive modeling.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="work-entry">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Policy &amp; Compliance</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Digital Services Act Compliance</h3>
            <p class="work-desc">
              Designed HubSpot's product strategy for complying with the EU Digital Services Act —
              navigating the intersection of regulatory requirements, platform architecture, and
              user experience at scale.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="work-entry">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Content Hub</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Content Remix</h3>
            <p class="work-desc">
              Launched Content Remix as part of the creation of Content Hub, quickly establishing
              the tool as a flagship AI product within HubSpot's portfolio.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="work-entry">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Search &amp; Discovery</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)</h3>
            <p class="work-desc">
              Launched HubSpot's AEO v1 feature set, setting the stage for the acquisition of
              XFunnel and the re-release of the v2 tools currently on the market.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="work-entry">
            <span class="work-employer">HubSpot &middot; Social</span>
            <h3 class="work-title">Social Insights</h3>
            <p class="work-desc">
              Conceptualized and launched HubSpot's Social Insights framework, built on Reddit
              data, to help brands extract meaningful audience and competitive insights from across
              the internet to inform their marketing strategies.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <article class="book" id="book-contact">
      <button class="book-spine" aria-controls="page-contact" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Get in touch">
        Get in Touch
      </button>
      <div class="book-page text-page" id="page-contact" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="page-header">
          <span class="chapter-num" aria-hidden="true">III</span>
          <h2 class="chapter-title">Get in Touch</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="page-body">
          <p class="contact-intro">
            If something here resonated — or if you're thinking about working together — I'd love to
            hear from you. Whether it's a consulting engagement, a creative collaboration, or just a
            good conversation, feel free to reach out.
          </p>
          <form
            name="contact"
            method="POST"
            data-netlify="true"
            class="contact-form"
            aria-label="Contact form"
          >
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name" class="form-label">Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" class="form-input" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email" class="form-label">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" class="form-input" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="message" class="form-label">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" required rows="5" class="form-input form-textarea"></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="form-submit">Send &rarr;</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>

  <script>
    const books = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.book');

    function openBook(target: HTMLElement) {
      books.forEach(book => {
        const isTarget = book === target;
        const spine = book.querySelector('button')!;
        const page  = book.querySelector('.book-page')!;

        book.dataset.open = isTarget ? 'true' : 'false';
        spine.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(isTarget));
        page.setAttribute('aria-hidden', String(!isTarget));
      });
    }

    books.forEach(book => {
      book.querySelector('button')!.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (book.dataset.open !== 'true') openBook(book);
      });
    });

    document.addEventListener('keydown', e => {
      if (e.key !== 'ArrowRight' && e.key !== 'ArrowLeft') return;
      const all  = [...books];
      const open = all.find(b => b.dataset.open === 'true');
      if (!open) return;
      const idx = all.indexOf(open);
      if (e.key === 'ArrowRight' && idx < all.length - 1) openBook(all[idx + 1]);
      if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft'  && idx > 0)              openBook(all[idx - 1]);
    });
  </script>
</Base>

<style>
  /* ── Shelf ── */
  .shelf {
    display: flex;
    height: 100dvh;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #1a130c;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  /* ── Book ── */
  .book {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    height: 100%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 64px;
    transition: width 500ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .book[data-open="true"] {
    width: clamp(380px, 52vw, 680px);
    flex-shrink: 1;
  }

  /* ── Spine ── */
  .book-spine {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    text-orientation: mixed;
    transform: rotate(180deg);

    position: relative;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 64px;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 2.5rem 0;

    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: #f2ede6;
    text-align: center;

    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: filter 0.25s, opacity 0.25s;

    /* binding groove */
    box-shadow:
      inset -4px 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
      4px 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  /* decorative rules top and bottom of spine */
  .book-spine::before,
  .book-spine::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 22px;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(242, 237, 230, 0.3);
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }
  .book-spine::after {
    margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
  }

  .book:not([data-open="true"]) .book-spine {
    opacity: 0.68;
  }
  .book:not([data-open="true"]) .book-spine:hover {
    opacity: 1;
    filter: brightness(1.2);
  }
  .book:not([data-open="true"]) .book-spine:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent-terra);
    outline-offset: -4px;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* spine colors */
  #book-cover      .book-spine { background: #2a2218; }
  #book-about      .book-spine { background: #3d2c1a; }
  #book-nonslopfun .book-spine { background: #c4783a; }
  #book-practical  .book-spine { background: #4a6e3a; }
  #book-hearth     .book-spine { background: #7a3a28; }
  #book-cabin      .book-spine { background: #3a5a48; }
  #book-work       .book-spine { background: #5c4830; }
  #book-contact    .book-spine { background: #6b5c4a; }

  /* ── Page ── */
  .book-page {
    flex: 1;
    height: 100%;
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    background: var(--color-bg);

    transform-origin: left center;
    transform: perspective(1400px) rotateY(-7deg);
    visibility: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;

    /* binding shadow on left edge */
    box-shadow: inset 10px 0 24px rgba(42, 34, 24, 0.2);

    transition:
      opacity 220ms ease,
      transform 500ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      visibility 0s linear 500ms;
  }

  .book[data-open="true"] .book-page {
    visibility: visible;
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transform: perspective(1400px) rotateY(0deg);
    transition:
      opacity 220ms ease 280ms,
      transform 500ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
      visibility 0s linear 0s;
  }

  /* ── Cover page ── */
  .cover-page {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--color-hero-bg);
    box-shadow: none;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cover-inner {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  .cover-photo {
    width: 130px;
    height: 130px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 25% 30%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(196, 120, 58, 0.45);
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
  }

  .cover-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-hero-text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .cover-rule {
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-accent-terra);
    margin: 1.25rem auto;
  }

  .cover-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #d4c8a8;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .cover-hint {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(184, 168, 130, 0.5);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  /* ── Text pages (About, Work, Contact) ── */
  .text-page {
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .chapter-num {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    opacity: 0.55;
    min-width: 1.2rem;
  }

  .chapter-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.8vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .page-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .pull-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 22px);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-terra);
    padding: 0.25rem 0 0.25rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
    quotes: none;
  }

  /* ── Project pages ── */
  .project-page {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .project-frontispiece {
    width: 100%;
    height: 240px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .project-frontispiece img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
  }

  .project-frontispiece--app {
    background: #f8f4ef;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .project-frontispiece--app img {
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: top center;
  }

  .project-frontispiece--photo img {
    object-position: center center;
  }

  .project-body {
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .project-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-terra);
  }

  .project-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.8vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .project-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    line-height: 1.8;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .project-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent-terra);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: text-decoration 0.15s;
  }
  .project-cta:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .project-cta-disabled {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* ── Work page ── */
  .work-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .work-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .work-entry {
    padding: 1.25rem 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .work-entry + .work-entry {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .work-employer {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
  }

  .work-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .work-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ── Contact page ── */
  .contact-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 460px;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .form-label {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-light);
  }

  .form-input {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    width: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    outline: none;
  }
  .form-input:focus { border-color: var(--color-ink-light); }

  .form-textarea {
    resize: vertical;
    min-height: 120px;
  }

  .form-submit {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-hero-text);
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .form-submit:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  .form-submit:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent-terra);
